// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P1745747966" "<t=4 d=4>These women...they're all like me. Living mindlessly, not knowing their former lives..."
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P2379887715" "<t=4 d=4>They deserve a real life, {HeroName}. One where they have a choice."
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P3666493051" "<t=4 d=4>This is our chance give back the life that Praetor Tilman stole from us!"
// 5 Caption :
"P2349686419" "<t=5 x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGray>Every single Seer in this lab is using their powers to protect the citizens of Praetoria..."
// 5 Caption :
"P3461835822" "<t=5 x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGray>From thwarting plots by the Destroyers to blow up skyscrapers..."
// 5 Caption :
"P4081206799" "<t=5 x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGray>...to saving children from being caught in the middle of Syndicate firefights."
// 5 Caption :
"P636144496" "<t=5 x= 0.6 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGray>Is it truly the right thing to free them, and subject the rest of Praetoria to that chaos?"
// LeftText :
"P923859775" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Free the Seers</color></scale><br>Help free the Seers</span><br><br><color Paragon>Aid the Resistance</color><br>Katie Douglas wants you to help her free the Seers from their stasis chambers. Once freed the the Resistance will ensure that they can live their own lives, or help in the fight against Tyrant. You'll need to deactivate the Network computers and then ensure they stay off!<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P3943180123" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Stop Katie Douglas</color></scale><br>Stop Katie from shutting down the Network</span><br><br><color orange>Aid the Loyalists</color><br>Katie Douglas is no longer part of the Seer Network, but these other Seers are. Removing these Seers from the Network would leave the PPD blind and extremely vulnerable. In their absence the Destroyers and Syndicate could wreck untold havoc on the city, endangering many lives.<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</scale></i>"

